          {
            "title": "Lesson #2 - Copy",
            "id": 130807,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>TypeScript'teki kesişim türleri, birden fazla türü tek bir türde birleştirmene olanak tanır.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"type\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Person = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" name: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"type\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Employee = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" employeeId: \" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"type\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" PersonEmployee = Person &amp; Employee;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"97\" /><option startIndex=\"107\" endIndex=\"108\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>PersonEmployee</code>, ardından <code>&amp;</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 130604,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir kesişim türü oluşturmak için birden fazla türü birleştirmek üzere <code>&amp;</code> kullanırız.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"type\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Person = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" name: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"type\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Employee = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" employeeId: \" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"type\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" PersonEmployee = Person &amp; Employee;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"107\" endIndex=\"108\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"|\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>&amp;</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 130605,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kesişim türündeki bir değişken, birleştirilen türlerin <strong>tümünü</strong> karşılamalıdır.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"type\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Person = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" name: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"type\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Employee = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" employeeId: \" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"type\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" PersonEmployee = Person &amp; Employee;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" someone: PersonEmployee = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" name: \" /><text value=\"&quot;Miriam&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" employeeId: \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(someone.name, someone.employeeId);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"153\" endIndex=\"168\" /><option startIndex=\"170\" endIndex=\"183\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"isAvailable: true\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Miriam 5\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>name: \"Miriam\",</code>, ardından <code>employeeId: 5</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 130606,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Her iki türe de uymayan bir değer atamaya çalışırsak TypeScript bir hata verecektir. Hatayı görmek için <strong>yanlış türü</strong> ayarla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"type\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Person = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" name: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"type\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Employee = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" employeeId: \" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"type\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" PersonEmployee = Person &amp; Employee;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" person: PersonEmployee = { name: \" /><text value=\"&quot;Amelia&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" }; \" /><text value=\"// Error\" class=\"comment\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"132\" endIndex=\"146\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Person\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Error: Type &quot;{ name: string; }&quot; is not assignable to type &quot;PersonEmployee&quot; - Property &quot;employeeId&quot; is missing in type &quot;{ name: string; }&quot; but required in type &quot;Employee&quot;.\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>PersonEmployee</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4 - Copy",
            "id": 130808,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kapsamlı türler oluşturmamıza olanak tanıyan kesişim türlerini kullanarak özel türleri genişletebiliriz. Bunu <code>&amp;</code> işaretiyle yaparız.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"type\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Person = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" name: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"type\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Employee = Person &amp; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" employeeId: \" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" person: Employee = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" name: \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lucas&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" employeeId: \" /><text value=\"123\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(person.name, person.employeeId);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"57\" /><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"59\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Lucas 123\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>Person</code>, ardından <code>&amp;</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 130607,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kesişim türlerinin gücü, TypeScript kodumuzda maksimum esnekliğe ulaşmak için mevcut türleri birleştirmemizde yatar.</p><p>Üç farklı nesne türünden bir kesişim türü oluşturmaya çalış.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"type\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" User = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" username: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"type\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ContactInfo = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" email: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"type\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Address = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  city: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"type\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" UserProfile = User &amp; ContactInfo &amp; Address;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"134\" endIndex=\"140\" /><option startIndex=\"141\" endIndex=\"152\" /><option startIndex=\"153\" endIndex=\"162\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"number[]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>User &amp;</code>, ardından <code>ContactInfo</code> ve son olarak <code>&amp; Address</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 130608,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>User</code> ve <code>Admin</code> arasında kesişim türü yazmanın doğru yolu nedir?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>User &amp; Admin</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>User and Admin</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>User &amp; Admin</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 130610,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bunlardan hangisi bir hatayla sonuçlanır?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"type\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Square = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" length: \" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"type\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Colorful = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" color: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"type\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ColorfulSquare = Square &amp; Colorful; \" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>let rect: ColorfulSquare = { length: 5 };</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>let rect: ColorfulSquare = { length: 5,  color: \"blue\" };</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>let rect: ColorfulSquare = { length: 5 };</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 130611,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Yeni bir kesişim türü oluştur.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"type\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Vehicle = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  make: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  model: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"type\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Features = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  hasSunroof: \" /><text value=\"boolean\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  hasNavigation: \" /><text value=\"boolean\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"type\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" VehicleWithFeatures = Vehicle &amp; Features;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"160\" endIndex=\"161\" /><option startIndex=\"162\" endIndex=\"170\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"|\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"AND\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>&amp;</code>, ardından <code>Features</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9 - Copy",
            "id": 130809,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>Pet</code>'in <code>Animal</code>'ın özniteliklerine de sahip olduğundan emin ol. Ardından <code>Pet</code> türünde bir değişken oluştur.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"type\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Animal = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" species: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"type\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Pet = Animal &amp; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" name: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" age: \" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" myPet: Pet = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" species: \" /><text value=\"&quot;Dog&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" name: \" /><text value=\"&quot;Buddy&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" age: \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(myPet.species, myPet.name, myPet.age);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"57\" /><option startIndex=\"104\" endIndex=\"107\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Animal\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Pet\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"|\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Dog Buddy 5\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>Animal</code>, ardından <code>&amp;</code> ve son olarak <code>Pet</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
